#
#	List of PCI ID's
#
#	Trimmed from the real pci.ids to the shapes the parser has to survive:
#	comments, a blank line, three vendor blocks, subsystem lines, and the
#	device-class sections that close the real file.
#

10de  NVIDIA Corporation
	2484  GA104 [GeForce RTX 3070]
		1043 87b3  TUF Gaming
		1462 3910  GeForce RTX 3070 VENTUS
	2684  AD102 [GeForce RTX 4090]
1002  Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. [AMD/ATI]
	164e  Raphael
	73df  Navi 22 [Radeon RX 6700/6700 XT/6750 XT / 6800M/6850M XT]

8086  Intel Corporation
	3e92  CoffeeLake-S GT2 [UHD Graphics 630]

# Device classes follow the vendor list in the real file. Their subclass lines
# are indented exactly like device lines, so a parser that keeps the previous
# vendor when a heading fails to parse files all of them under Intel.
C 00  Unclassified device
	00  Non-VGA unclassified device
	01  VGA compatible unclassified device
C 03  Display controller
	00  VGA compatible controller
		00  VGA controller
